<title>USA: Tele-Communications Intl Q4 loss of $29 mln.</title>
<headline>Tele-Communications Intl Q4 loss of $29 mln.</headline>
<dateline>ENGLEWOOD CO. 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Net loss		  29,000   profit	95,000</p>
<p> Revs			95,000		   67,000</p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $1.10   profit	 $0.28</p>
<p> Net loss		 130,000   profit	30,000</p>
<p> Revs		     315,000		  191,000</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1995 quarterly and annual earnings include a gain of $165 million on the sale of stock by Telewest Communications plc.</p>
<p>Operating cash flow totaled $32 million in 1996 and $29 million in 1995.</p>
<p>Full name of company is Tele-Communications International Inc</p>
